WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.280
The platform separates team workflows
from shared assurance services.

00:00:03.378 --> 00:00:06.440
Approved context feeds a bounded runtime.

00:00:06.533 --> 00:00:10.400
An external gateway checks requested
actions before tools execute.

00:00:10.487 --> 00:00:15.280
Independent evaluation and sandbox checks
produce evidence for a release owner.

00:00:15.413 --> 00:00:18.880
Reviewed failures return
to the regression corpus.

00:00:19.060 --> 00:00:23.280
Inspect the components or use
the flow controls to follow a path.

00:00:23.380 --> 00:00:26.160
The arrows represent
architecture relationships,

00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:27.840
not a live production trace.
